From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kanadaj <kanadaj@royalroad.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 23:38:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Query VictoriaLogs instead of the Loki API

Call VictoriaLogs' /select/logsql endpoints (query, hits,
stats_query_range, stream_field_values, streams, tail) under the same
/api/logs/v1/<tenant> prefix and convert the responses into the Loki
shapes the pages render: JSON lines become streams, hits become the
histogram and volume matrices, and a query with a stats pipe is charted
like a LogQL metric query. Live tail reads the streamed tail response
instead of a Loki websocket.
